    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Common (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>While this doll is within 5 feet of you, you can spend a Short Rest teaching it up to six phrases, none longer than six words, and setting a condition under which it says each one. You can also replace old phrases with new ones. Whatever the condition, it must happen within 5 feet of the doll for the doll to speak—for instance, the doll might say “I want a piece of candy” whenever someone picks it up. The doll forgets its phrases when your Attunement to it ends.</p>",
